window.products.push({"id":380147,"name":"Artbros Vegetable Chopper Onion Chopper - 12 in 1 Multi-Functional Mandoline Slicer Veggie Fruit Dicer Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CkYXeUOGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional vegetable cutter and slicer, 8 interchangeable blades, allow flexibility to easily cut, slice, dice, chop fruits and vegetables in shapes and sizes for minimum time. Easy disassembly and installation.You can use the chopper with various vegetables, fruits and even cheese. The chopper is the kitchen appliances of the modern woman. These kitchen tools and kitchen accessories make life easier.Specification:1. Color: Black2. Material: BPA-free food grade plastic and stainless steel3. Size:10.83\"L x 4.65\"W x 4.65\"HPackage Include:1 x Removable Mandolinist Slicer2 x Dicer blades（big and small)2 x Slicer blades（Smooth and wavy shape）2 x Filamentous blades （Coarse and small）1 x Mince ginger Ground blade1 x Container with Lid1 x Hand guard1× Food Drain Basket1 x Cleaning ToolNote:1. When the remaining one third of the vegetables, use a hand guard to avoid hurting your hand.2. Hard Large fruits or vegetables like apple or potato need to be quartered or halved before slipping them on.3. Make sure the vegetables & fruits are smaller than the blades' frame.otherwise some hard vegetables may stick to the blade.4. No putting blades randomly, after rinsing and drying, pls collect them into the container and keep them away from children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CkYXeUOGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artbros","source_asin":"B07CK1FHHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CK1FHHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CK1FHHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":380148,"name":"HIDBEA One Way Mirror Window Film Daytime Privacy, Heat Control UV Blocking Reflective Window Tint for Home, Non-Adhesive Self Static Cling Window Sti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qOv85LxSS._AC_SL1146_.jpg","description":"UV BLOCKING & HEAT CONTROL – This anti-glare reflective window film is designed to sun blocking and keep out 90% of harmful UV rays and 85% of infrared rays which can damage the eyes and the skin. Heat insulation window tinting film for home can save energy for intense summers, and provide coverage year round thus reducing expensive heating and cooling costs for your home. SUPERIOR DAYTIME PRIVACY PROTECTION – Applying our window privacy film see out not in lets you see out and does not let prying eyes see in during daytime while letting natural lights in, and from the outside, the glass shows a mirror like reflective surface. NOTICE: When the inside light is stronger than the outside light at night, the house window tint CANNOT provide privacy, and the mirror reflective effect will disappear. Do remember to draw the curtains during the night. ADVANCED STATIC CLING APPLICATION - This window tinting film uses static cling to easily stick to the window with a glue-free design. Just clean the window, soak the sticking surface film in water and apply with a squeegee to remove excess water and air bubbles. Our one-way window films can also be removed with no sticky chemical residue! Tips: Watching our installation video will be very helpful. MULTIPURPOSE USE - HIDBEA home window tint film privacy can be used in kitchens, living rooms, bedrooms, sliding doors, commercial buildings, offices, waiting areas, attics, enclosed porches, and anywhere with glass windows where you want to block the sun’s harsh UV light or intense heat. (Window privacy film CANNOT be applied to DOUBLE-PANED glass) TRUSTED AFTER-SALES SERVICE - We want to provide you with the best one way window tint privacy, as well as with excellent customer service you can rely on. In adding it to your shopping cart, you take the first step towards privacy. We’ll always be here to answer questions and provide quick support. The ball’s in your court now, try it out, you’ll surely be glad you did.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qOv85LxSS._AC_SL1146_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIDBEA","source_asin":"B0BW922B61","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW922B61","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW922B61","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
