window.products.push({"id":380239,"name":"LunchBots 8oz Thermos Stainless Steel - Insulated Thermos - Keeps Food Hot or Cold for Hours - Leak-Proof Portable Thermal Food Jar is Ideal for Soup ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w02jLG9XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SUPERIOR INSULATION: We developed our triple-insulated Thermal technology to keep food at just the right temperature! Our insulated Thermal food containers stay cold for up to 12 hours or hot for over 6 hours. We’re so confident in our Thermoses that we guarantee it will outperform a product of the same capacity from any other brand. ALL STAINLESS STEEL INTERIOR: Enjoy a hot cup of soup without your food touching plastic! The Thermal’s interior, including the lid, is made of durable 18/8 stainless steel. Dishwasher safe for a no-hassle cleanup. PERFECT SIZE: The Thermal serves up a perfectly portioned side of soup! Its 3” diameter is ideal for little hands and makes it easy to eat directly from the container. It goes great with the LunchBots Uno, Duo, Trio, Quad, and Cinco containers and fits in our Duplex thermal lunch bag. LEAK PROOF DESIGN: When you have a hectic schedule, you need a food jar that can keep up! Completely leak proof, the Thermal is a must-have for grab-and-go mornings. You can drop it in your purse, briefcase or backpack without the worry of accidental spills or messes. TRUSTED BRAND: We designed the original LunchBots stainless steel food container over 10 years ago. We’re still dedicated to creating the highest quality products. LunchBots containers last a lifetime and our customer service team is always here to help!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w02jLG9XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LunchBots","source_asin":"B07BVDGJ6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BVDGJ6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BVDGJ6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":380240,"name":"Insulated Tea Infuser Bottle, Pink, 16 oz. - Stainless Steel Coffee Tumbler with Long Double Infuser for Loose Tea - Cold and Hot Thermos Water Bottle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hHFqlfpFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALWAYS ENJOY EASY FLAVOR: When you’re out and about, you always want to stay hydrated with convenient, flavorful beverages that are ready for anything and always enjoyable. Keep your tastebuds satisfied with this amazing Tea Thermos with Infuser from LiQds, a travel infuser bottle that lets you customize your drink and make sure it’s ready to go! Complete with a strainer and infuser basket, this tea infuser tumbler is perfect for loose tea and fruit infusions. It can also be used as a cold brew coffee mug for your favorite drinks! Add flavor to your water anytime, anywhere with this Tea Infuser Bottle for loose tea, coffee, and fruit, so that you can keep hydrated while traveling, exercising, or working. WHAT’S INCLUDED: ◆(1) Insulated Infuser Bottle ◆(1) Long Double Infuser PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: ◆Volume: 16 ounces (480ml) ◆Materials: 304 and 302 Stainless Steel ◆Color: Navy ◆Also Available in Black or Pink DESIGNED FOR TRAVELING: Made with a strong, high-quality combination of 304 and 302 stainless steel, this water bottle with tea infuser is corrosion-resistant and durable, to hold up to any trip. Our tea travel mug with infuser and lid features double-walled insulation to keep your drink at the perfect temperature. This beverage tumbler can be used for hot or cold drinks. With a simple, modern design available in multiple colors, this versatile bottle with tea strainer is perfect for men and women. Our tea bottle infuser has a matte finish that always looks great. From road trips to work, this hot and ice tea infuser tumbler is the ideal gift for anyone who is always on the go! Sturdy and leakproof, our loose tea tumbler is convenient and ready to go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hHFqlfpFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LiQds+","source_asin":"B08T66HXDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T66HXDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T66HXDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
