window.products.push({"id":380322,"name":"Cuisipro 83758000 Foam Pump, Chrome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+0AOCrZDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cuisipro proudly debuts its collection of foam pump dispensers in an array of eye-catching colors to complement any kitchen, bathroom or powder room setting. The new colors include green, red, orange, pink, black and chrome. Cuisipro’s environmentally friendly pumps deliver a host of consumer benefits: they look great on the counter, reduce waste and provide for a luxurious hand washing experience that encourages more thorough washing. Enjoy an aerosol-free way to turn store-bought liquid soap into more efficient cleansing foam while reducing soap usage up to 75-percent. The uniquely designed angle dispenses foam directly into the hand, and a suction cup on the bottom keeps the dispenser from slipping and sliding on the counter. The dispenser is easy to operate one handed and the non-aerosol pump mechanism stays clog-free. The pump is easy and safe to clean in the top rack of the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+0AOCrZDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisipro","source_asin":"B009KYY8U0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009KYY8U0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009KYY8U0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":380323,"name":"Luxury Hotel & Spa Towel Turkish Cotton & Bamboo Rayon (White, Bath Towel - Set of 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kJ2lET4sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These premium luxury towels have an extra soft feel and are super absorbent, more so than cotton. They are versatile enough to be a daily luxury that you won't feel guilty spending on! The Natural Organic Bamboo Rayon and Turkish Cotton fibers are produced for extra strength so these towels feel and look great for years. You will enjoy drying off with our silky smooth Bath Towels. These luxurious Bamboo Rayon Towels come in generously sized bath towels, hand towels, and wash cloths. All sizing is listed below. Bath Towel: Size - 55 by 26 inches ( 140 by 60 cm) Hand Towel: Size - 32 by 18 inches ( 81 by 45 cm) Wash Cloths: Size - 15 by 12 inches ( 38 by 32 cm)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kJ2lET4sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chakir Turkish Linens","source_asin":"B00IPMO47K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IPMO47K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IPMO47K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":380324,"name":"JS Sanders 1500 Thread Count Sheet Set, Full Size, Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zW9jKMBeL._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a cool and comfortable night's sleep on these brilliant sheets. Made from deluxe micro fiber, these sheets are designed to be durable yet extremely soft. This micro fiber material makes these sheets feel as soft as 1500 thread count Egyptian cotton, at a fraction of the price. It also means you can rest easy knowing they are going to last you for years to come and will maintain their vibrant color and softness. These sheets are also easy care, woven from wrinkle free fabric, and require no ironing. The fitted sheets are made with extra deep pockets to fit any size mattress (up to 18” thick) quickly and securely. Please note: Different computer screens may display colors with variations. We try to represent the sheet colors as accurately as possible; however actual sheet colors may vary slightly from those shown. Due to the personal aspect of sheets, we cannot accept return or exchanges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zW9jKMBeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BedInABox","source_asin":"B00415WPPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00415WPPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00415WPPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
