window.products.push({"id":380406,"name":"RNK Shops Sugar Skulls & Flowers Toothbrush Holder (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xlK1iaBjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform the look of your bathroom with one of our toothbrush holders! These personalized toothbrush holders will add a charming splash of subtle decor to your bathroom, but when customized with bright patterns and colors, they can easily serve as an accent piece for your bathroom space. Customize a few for yourself, or put your childrens names and favorite animals to make the perfect kids' toothbrush holder! Not to mention, the fun designs and unique personalization make it easy to keep toothbrushes separate, and they might serve as a fun incentive to get your little ones to brush their teeth!These bathroom toothbrush holders are built from acrylic, making them durable enough to withstand daily use. The stand itself is made of three different pieces: an inner cup, a base, and the lid featuring the four holes. Each toothbrush stand has a twist-off lid for easy cleaning and also features 4 holes to accommodate 4 toothbrushes. While designed for toothbrushes, these holders are multifunctional, and can be used for makeup brushes, paintbrushes, and more! Your customization is displayed on the side of this product on a fine-quality, vinyl insert.To clean your toothbrush holder, simply screw off the lid and wipe down with a wet cloth and some mild detergent. Wash the inner piece with some warm water and soap.Design Shown: Sugar Skulls & Flowers (#272060)Features:==================================== * Built from a durable acrylic  * Features three pieces: base, inner cup, and lid * Screw-on lid with 4 holes to fit 4 toothbrushes * Suitable for toothbrushes, makeup brushes, and more * Customization displayed on high-quality, vinyl inserts * Made for you in the USAInstructions:==================================== * To clean untwist lid and remove inner piece, wash with water, soap, or mild detergent * Wipe down outside with cloth and water or mild detergent","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xlK1iaBjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B0104YUOZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0104YUOZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0104YUOZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
