window.products.push({"id":380408,"name":"LAKEA Black and White Mountain Tapestry Star Black Tapestry Forest Tree Landscape Wall Tapestries Moon Star Tapestry Psychedelic Tapestry for Bedroom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t5WLLfZPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Amazing Design】This black and white mountain tapestry design combine elements of mountains, stars, and the moon. Vivid and clear patterns, crisp lines, and delicate hemming add more permanent harmonious decoration to your home. 【Premium Material】Mountain moon tapestry is made of 100% polyester fabric, which is soft, durable, does not transmit light, and is lightweight to be hung indoors and outdoor. Also, our tapestry printing method is more environmentally friendly, which can ensure that the tapestry you receive does not have an unpleasant chemical smell. 【Easy Installation】For easy to hang, we also prepared an installation package for you. A pack of hanging accessories contains 3 traceless thumbtacks, 3 metal clips, 3 3M double-sided stickers. You can easily hang it where you want. You can use the seamless nails to fix the position in the wall, and 2 clips to clasp the top corners of the tapestry. 【Recommended Use】Great for Wall hangings, Bedroom Decorations, Dorm Decorations, Picnic Blankets, Porch Hangings, Table Cloths, Bed Spreads, Window Curtains, Sofa Covers, or another room idea. It’s a Perfect Gift for any Occasion! 【Care Instructions】For this star black tapestry, don't worry about the wrinkles out, please hand wash or machine wash with cold water under a gentle cycle. Hang to dry and iron it at low temperature.do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t5WLLfZPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAKEA","source_asin":"B09J3NCFG1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J3NCFG1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J3NCFG1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
