window.products.push({"id":380428,"name":"Mecity Coffee Maker 3-in-1 Single Serve Coffee Machine, For K-Cup Coffee Capsule Pod, Ground Coffee Brewer, Loose Tea maker, 6 to 10 Ounce Cup, Remova","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y2vV7tWNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Coffee Maker is Effortlessly Simple to Use - just add fresh water to the removable reservoir, pop in your favorite K-Cup pod, press the brew button, and enjoy fresh-brewed, delicious coffee in minutes Also Good at Brewing Loose Tea - There are 3 filters in the coffee machine, when you want to have a cup of tea, you do not have to boil a kettle of water, just add leaf tea and wait a moment, then you can enjoy the sipping Enjoy precise & quick brewing - This single serve coffee maker has a smart flow management system to realize the precise brewing, brew an 6, 8, or 10 oz. cup at the push of a button, and just wait for 60 to 100 seconds. Fit anywhere on the countertop - the coffee machine is 6.3 inch in width and 10.6 inch in height, you can always find its space in your kitchen and portable for travel. The reservoir has a capacity of 50 fl Oz., capable of brewing 8 cups of drinks. Maximum fit cup size is 3.7\" in width and 6.3\" in height. Easy to Clean - BPA-FREE material for water tank and piercing needle. Detachable filter basket and drip tray can be removed and washed directly. A easy clean method by pressing button after adding in water and vinegar. Descale Mode - When the medium cup button and start button flashes, it is in descale mode, take out the pods, and brew 6 cups of hot water will finish descaling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y2vV7tWNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mecity","source_asin":"B09X1SHWMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X1SHWMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X1SHWMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
