window.products.push({"id":380651,"name":"Boska Holland Stainless Steel Mini Cheese Slicer and Plane, Flex Blade, 10 Year Guarantee, Monaco Collection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mJnQRbhHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cheese Slicer Mini MonacoGood things come in small packages! This contemporary, ergonomically designed slicer made of 100% high quality stainless steel is a true crowd pleaser. Its compact size makes it perfect for picnics or traveling, ideal for slicing small cuts of cheese or cold butter, a useful tool for kids, and a great gift.-IDEAL GIFT: Small, light, and stylish design-SUPERIOR TASTE: Slicing aerates the cheese, making the flavor more intense-EUROPEAN DESIGN: 100% stainless steelFor which types of cheese?This small, stylish slicer is best suited to slicing semi-hard to hard cheese. Try it out on cheeses like Gouda, Edam, and Cheddar!Why should you slice cheese?A cheese slicer is the perfect tool for the true connoisseur. When you freshly slice cheese, the cheese comes into contact with oxygen, which helps the cheese to reach its fullest flavor - just like wine. Thin slices have nothing to do with being frugal ;-)MaintenanceThis cheese slicer is dishwasher safe, however we do recommend that you hand wash this tool so it stays sharp - just like all high quality knives.10 Year GuaranteeBoska Holland works hard to procure materials of the highest quality and produce its products through expert manufacturing. We’re proud of our cheese tools and believe they will stand the test of time, so we offer you a 10 year guarantee on this product.About Boska Holland Cheese waresWe love cheese! Since 1896, here at Boska, it’s been our mission to spread the love of cheese to everyone everywhere. Our innovative family-owned company started as a blacksmith making tools for the cheese farmers in Holland, and now we are the world’s only specialist in Cheese wares: cheese tools and accessories. In short: we sell everything you need to enjoy cheese except the cheese itself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mJnQRbhHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B075D2LGBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075D2LGBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075D2LGBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
