window.products.push({"id":380653,"name":"Night Stands for Bedrooms Bedroom Led Nightstand Modern Nightstand with Drawers Side Bed Table with Led Light Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mjZMXLk2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-quality Material: Made of particle board, it is sturdy, aging-resistant, and deformation-resistant. Meanwhile, the veneering process makes it more wear-resistant and corrosion-resistant. Unique Light Show: LED light with 16 colors, 6 brightness settings and 4 lighting modes can be freely adjusted by remote control to design a unique light show according to your preferences. It can also be used as a small night light to keep you away from the darkness and help you sleep peacefully. Large Capacity: Two drawers and a top platform provide you with enough storage space for your household goods and decorations, fully meeting your storage needs and bringing a neat room. Strong Weight-bearing: The stable base and rectangular structure ensure a strong load-bearing capacity (above 110lbs), allowing you to store a variety of items with confidence. Easy to Access: The open top platform puts your coffee at your fingertips and the smooth track with low noise makes the drawer easily opened for easy access. Cozy Companion: It provides a place for your bedtime reading. Choose a book from your nightstand at night, put a glass of milk on it, and enjoy a cozy bedtime. Save Space: The nightstand has a small footprint of 19.7x13.8in that makes the most of vertical space and only needs to be placed in a corner. Easy to Assemble: Its simple structure, complete accessories, and installation drawing help you complete the installation easily and quickly. You can also enjoy assembling it with your family. Ships from USA, about 2-7 days shipping time. 100% quality guaranteed, If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us, we will give you a satisfactory answer within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mjZMXLk2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YIYIBYUS","source_asin":"B09JC3NR77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JC3NR77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JC3NR77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
