window.products.push({"id":380712,"name":"Vertical Grind Cold Press Juicer, Anti-Oxidation Wide Chute Slow Grinding Juicer with 60 RPM 240W AC Motor & Large 3” Mouth the Ultimate Fruit and Veg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":82.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g+K1h-iPL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"ULTIMATE VERTICAL SLOW GRIND - Compared to juice from centrifugal juicers, SKG offers juice that is much more nutritious, tastes better and fresher, lasting longer. Our high quality 240W AC motor runs at a low speed of 60 RPMs, the golden ratio of force and time. Ingredients are juiced with minimal oxidation, preserving the benefits of natural taste and preventing nutrient loss unlike high-speed centrifugal juicers that grind, crush, and heat the ingredients with fast rotating blades. LARGE WIDE-MOUTH CHUTE – 3” chute can easily accommodate large produce. More resistant to clogging, greatly reducing preparation and cleanup time. Less chopping of ingredients also aids in reducing oxidation. MAXIMUM ANTI-OXIDANT JUICE YIELD – Providing a high juice yield with our premium strainer base and valve offers a sealed space to contain the juice during the juicing process to prevent oxidation. This signature valve should always be shut during juicing. The valve is designed to keep the juice within the sealed space during the juicing process, preventing oxidation and leading to a more nutritious and delicious juice. SUPERIOR QUALITY CONTROL – To ensure that every product is devoid of defects, each and every part of the product is personally examined as part of a very strict quality control system. All working parts (the stainless steel, silicone components and PEI juicing screw) are made of high quality TRITAN food grade anti-oxidation materials. This juicer is certified by ETL, CE, and ROHS. DEVOTED CUSTOMER SERVICE - For all Amazon customers, your purchase comes with an Amazon-backed 30-day return policy. SKG offers a two-year warranty for all parts and accessories. All of our product warranties are automatically registered with your Amazon order ID. No other proof or registration is required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g+K1h-iPL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viesimple","source_asin":"B09VNTWR17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VNTWR17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VNTWR17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
