window.products.push({"id":380720,"name":"Coozi Compact ULV Aurora Humidifier, Ultra-Low Volume Mist, Humidifying/Aroma Diffusing, Two Misting Modes, Soothing Low White Noise, Aurora Vibe Ligh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OWGLleZcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Make Air Better with coozi】: Maintaining proper air moisture levels in your home is important for your health, your comfort and the condition of your belongings. Coozi Compact ULV Humidifier adds micro-size moisture droplets and ionized water particles into the air to prevent respiratory symptoms or dry skin. Can also be used as aroma diffuser when adding desired essential oil into water for refreshing or therapy purpose. 【Sleep Better with coozi】: Sleep with moisturized air can prevent influenza, relief coughs and even reduce snoring. Coozi Compact ULV Humidifier not only create proper humidity level in the air, plus its soothing low vaporizing sound acting as white noise, making it an ideal sleeping assistant. Two lighting modes to choose from aurora vibe lighting or warm night light. 【Ultra-Low Volume Fine Misting】Coozi Compact ULV Humidifier’s water tank size is only 10OZ, but can continue misting for 6 hours. It produces ultra-fine misting particles, which requires much less water to create proper air moisture levels comparing with other regular humidifiers. 【Easy to Operate】: Just fill tank with water to use as a humidifier, or add extra 2 drops of desired essential oil to add aroma. Short press to toggle between misting modes and misting off. Long press to toggle between lighting modes and lighting off. USB power supply compatible with any USB port. For use either at home, office or in a car without concern of electricity hazard. (High volume essential oil may damage nozzle. Suggest rinse the tube and nozzle after use to prevent nozzle clog) 【Safe Auto Shut-off】: Worry about water runs out? Not necessary. Coozi Compact ULV Humidifier smart self-protection function automatically turns itself off once water runs out, so you can enjoy the cozy air with peace of mind!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OWGLleZcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"coozi","source_asin":"B099DN2HWK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099DN2HWK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099DN2HWK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
