window.products.push({"id":380808,"name":"Trenton Gifts Depression-Era Green Glass Juicer w/Measuring Cup, Retro Kitchen Wedding Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8142pnpINpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the help of this tool, you’ll be able to have your favorite fruit drink at the drop of a hat. This tool is great for making just enough juice to satisfy your craving without making too much. For an even healthier option, choose a pink grapefruit and use this extractor to get all the juice from it. Add this citrus squeezer to your kitchen equipment and you’ll be surprised how much you use it. To use, simply cut the desired fruit in half, place the tip of the juicer at the center of the fruit, press in, and twist to extract all the juice you want. Use this kitchen utensil at your next bbq party or summertime activity with the family to make homemade lemonade. You can also have this handheld juicer tool on hand in case someone needs an extra squirt of lime on their taco or lemon on their salad. It’s so easy to use, even your kids will love helping you in the kitchen. The reamer lid fits securely into the cup and will strain out the seeds and extra pulp and the spouted cup makes it easy to simply pour and drink. This unique gadget makes a great collectible item for any lover of vintage-looking knick-knacks. The great thing about this unique kitchen accessory is that it has an antique appearance without actually being old, giving it the look you want while still working optimally. If you are looking for the perfect wedding or housewarming gift, this depression-era-inspired glassware makes a great option that the happy couple is sure to love. In addition to having a vintage feel, this stylish juicer also has a bit of a farmhouse air that is sure to add a pop of color to any rustic decor. Try Trenton Gifts for all your fancy kitchen decor and check out all of our other Depression-era-inspired glassware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8142pnpINpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trenton Gifts","source_asin":"B07NVWY12S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NVWY12S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NVWY12S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
