window.products.push({"id":380838,"name":"Robobrew V3 with Pump","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fAQi4cJsL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"All in one brewing systems with recirculating pumps are where it's at. They make brewing simple and easy and get home brewers doing all-grain earlier, many starter with their very first batch. The is going to lead the charge with its amazing price point. The is an all-in-one electric brewing system that has built in elements for heating and boiling, a built in pump for recirculation, an onboard water resistant control panel for setting and monitoring temperatures, a removable grain basket, and a built in spigot for transferring. It is extremely portable and uses 110v power so it can be used nearly anywhere. Built in magnetic drive pump to easily recirculate the wort during the mash. We recommend getting some silicone tubing to go with the recirculation arm. This allows you more control over the recirculation and you can then use the pump to transfer your wort to your fermenter. Dual heating elements run off of a single 110 volt plug and have individual switches allowing for more control over the heating process. One element is 1000 watts and the other is 500 for a combined 1500 watts! Use both when you need to ramp up the temperature quickly either at the start to get to your mash temp or to go from your mash temp to boiling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fAQi4cJsL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Robobrew","source_asin":"B079MGBT1F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-380838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079MGBT1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079MGBT1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
