window.products.push({"id":381000,"name":"panergy Misting Fan, Portable 8\" Clip on Fan with Mist, 10000mAh Rechargeable Battery Operated Personal Fan, 2 Mist Modes, 3 Speeds & 360° Rotation Sp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cs1q3WqsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Portable Misting Fan】Equipped with 2 adjustable spray settings: intermittent mode and continuous mode, offering the most comfortable cooling mist to beat the summer heat. The capacity of the water tank is 125ml, which can last for 90 min on setting 1 or 45 min on setting 2. When the water runs out, you can refill via the hole on top, keeping you cool and moist all day long. 【10000mAh Rechargeable Battery】Built-in a huge 10000mAh rechargeable battery, it takes about 6 hours to fully charge and provides 7-28 hours duration. It supports multiple charging by power bank, laptop or any power source with USB output port. During charging it can run on the first setting.The battery operated fan is very convenient for you to carry at outdoors. 【3 Powerful Airflow】Adopting brushless motor and high-end aerodynamic fan blades, it can create up to 11.8 ft./s strong airflow to cool you down immediately. 3 optional speeds and 360° vertical and horizontal rotation make sure it blows in the way you want. 【Timer Feature】Comes with 3 timers, you can press the timer button to choose among 1H/2H/5H timer, customizing your own time for the fan and misting to turn off automatically. A thoughtful and humanized design for your daily use. 【Sturdy Clip & Foldable Hook】This versatile USB misting fan with a 2.4” strong clamp can be mounted in any corner or as a desk fan. There is a foldable hook at the bottom of the base for easy hanging or storage. Clip on handles, standing on desktops, hanging in tents, etc., it is ideal to keep you cool and moist on the hot and dry summer days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cs1q3WqsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"panergy","source_asin":"B0BQMW2SR6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQMW2SR6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQMW2SR6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
